    "title": "MyTonWallet \u2022 TON Wallet",
    "description": "The most feature-rich TON wallet \u2013 with support of multi-accounts, tokens, NFT, TON DNS, TON Sites.\r\n\r\nSecurely store and transfer crypto, earn from staking, explore decentralized apps, and make blockchain payments at the speed of light. Install this wallet to connect your browser to The Open Network.\r\n\r\nEnjoy additional features such as interactive price charts, address book, anti-spam filters, and integration with third-party services such as CoinMarketCap, tonscan.org, and Getgems.\r\n\r\nThe wallet is non-custodial and safe. Developers do not have access to your funds, browser history or any other information.",
